> 
> -- 
> To unsubscribe: send e-mail to axp-list-request@redhat.com with
> 'unsubscribe' as the subject.  Do not send it to axp-list@redhat.com

So you are getting a 54% utilization of the SCSI bus.  Not bad.  You may
be able to do even better.  Try running the test from multiple processes
simultaneously.  It would allow overlapping of command processing with data
transfers, and the sum of the transfer rates from each process should be
closer to the maximum bus transfer rate.

Kelvin


