Processor Correctable machine checks, from the Alpha Architecture Ref Man,
have as examples: corrected processorinternal cache errors, and corrected
translation buffer table errors.

These are not good. Any chance that the processor is overheating, ie the
fan died? Or got an electrical spike that might have hurt the CPU?

