With no floppies in the box on a fresh boot, you should get the srm prompt
( >>> ).  At that point you should simply say arc <cr> and get to the
arc console.  If that's not happening, you need to snag the f/w update
utility (from gatekeeper among others).  The images in the RH distro
do not support SRM very well on the Multia.  You can get there, but it's
a lot of work.  Also hit www.alphalinux.org  README's for these are
in the same places.
Good luck!
