XiG and Metro both support this.
Metro is cheaper, but slower ( in our tests slower than XFree!)
XiG is more expensive, but definitely faster.
Make sure these are Permedia2, NOT Permedia2V chip based cards.
Good: Elsa Gloria Synergy, Diamond FireGL Pro
Not good: AccelGraphics AccelSTAR.


