> capable of using multiple cards in any manner.

I use metroX in an XL300 with two Matrox Millennium's (the old type). Works
like a charm. One is connected to a 21'' eizo grayscale monitor (1600x1200) and
one to a 15'' Color thing (1024x768)

Advantages
	-Works! (XFree cashes with two cards)
	-Costs money/commercial

Disadvantages
	-Both displays must be run in the same color depth! (i use 16bit, a bit
	of a waste on the grayscale monitor)    
	- X grows up to 21Mb

Cheers -- Jaap

