firmware update from gatekeeper.dec.com.

Format both of them, make one a "DOS" (FAT) disk.

Rename the *.exe firmware to fwupdate.exe and put it on the DOS formatted
floppy. Label it fwupdate.exe.

The other one do a "dd if=thefile.sys of=/dev/fd0 bs=256k' change as
needed. Label this one SRM2ARC.

Place the on labeled "SRM2ARC" in the floppy drive and at the

>>>

prompt type 'boot dva0', after it finishes and your in ARC, take the disk
out and replace it with the "fwupdate.exe" floppy. Choose "supplementary
menu" and then "update firmware", it should then flash ARC into SROM.

