> created, the compilation runs (almost) fine. I checked the docs at cygnus
> but could not find something I thought related. Does anyone know what
> xmkmf intends to include and what I have to change to get it work (or
> which rtfm I have to read) ?

I ran into this too... The answer is:

$ more /usr/X11R6/lib/X11/config/linux.cf | grep LinuxMachineDefines
#define LinuxMachineDefines     -D__i386__
#define LinuxMachineDefines     -D__alpha__
#define LinuxMachineDefines     -D__mc68000__
#define StandardDefines         -Dlinux LinuxMachineDefines 
LinuxSourceDefines

If you compile on Alpha, You should replace LinuxMachineDefines
with -D__alpha__

